The DRC Rule Editor's constraint pictures (constraint_*.png) are KiCad's rendered bitmaps from resources/bitmaps_png/png at the same commit
(constraint_<name>.png for light, constraint_<name>_dark.png for dark), under the same license.

The Draw Arc mode icons (add_arc_center, add_arc_start_end_mid, add_arc_start_end_center, add_arc_tangent, add_arc_start_dir_end) are KiCad 10's, newer than
that commit: resources/bitmaps_png/sources/{light,dark} at 25ec2335f2, under the same license.
